{"version":1,"content":"<p>由於擔心黃仁勳離職會衝擊英偉達管理層，凱西・伍德（Cathie Wood）此前減持了價值近1.07億美元的英偉達股票。而這家晶片巨頭隨後宣佈恢復黃仁勳職務，股價迎來多年最強單日漲幅，這次賣出操作也因此踏空、事與願違。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587806.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:04:08.408517+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:39:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_hash":"ce9c302f7b506b424b1be635e529e52b33cb23a2a37df2fc39d14a99ba8d5f9e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}